{"data":{"body":"**Medium:** Formatting every `BotoCoreError` with `str(exc)` can expose credential-provider stderr (for example, through `CredentialRetrievalError`) in console, JSON, JUnit, and GitHub-summary diagnostics. The downstream redactor only replaces known environment-secret values, so arbitrary sensitive provider output remains visible. Preserve detailed text for `ClientError` service responses only, retain type-only diagnostics for other botocore failures, and add a regression test using sensitive credential-provider stderr.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx87pphMf","finding_digest":"ab938f84346057ef360114d501618df8d78aad5a43fb884d9a89a5197c7bc016","finding_id":"arf_v1_vojy7bbumbl66nqbctkqcymn7d","finding_key":"aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel.backends.xray::xraybackend._lookup::botocore-error-redaction","identity_key":"aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel.backends.xray::xraybackend._lookup::botocore-error-redaction","line":173,"observation_digest":"ae452c60a689fb90066f469e0b385b84f0519452c1376fe3b36c1229f48ddb9d","observation_id":"aro_v1_vzcsyyfgrh5zabtpi2pawoc3qt","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/backends/xray.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_vojy7bbumbl66nqbctkqcymn7d","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:38:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ylxufm4hgpnrysh56okzbi43bf","reviewed_base_sha":"c31f95f448a4fe8ffb93203c7920a48e87362801","reviewed_head_sha":"7bd3786388573a346ea7a3ec881bd6c6b0ac3947","reviewer":"codex","start_line":171,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_jd4z6ro3rqb4ab6pmxdwyi3jwk"},"pull_request":{"number":110},"record_id":"art_v1_jlcy7gbxteklo7vrqhipbq4kva","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:38:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
